  <item>
    <title>EP12. INFP愉悦清单：这一刻，世界治愈我</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e1b179ee04007d88deb5a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e1b179ee04007d88deb5a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 15:04:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello，大家好！又是两周没见啦（没错我们偷偷改成双周更了…/戳手/嘟嘴）</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期的节目精彩啦！我们重磅推出了愉悦清单！</span></p><span></span><p><span>试问谁没有过深夜emo的时刻呢？谁不曾在工作中陷入自我否定呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>不知道为了什⬇么o，忧愁总围绕着Woo~</span></p><span></span><p><span>都是过来人！我们懂你！就是现在，所有人集合！一起来交流学习属于自己的愉悦清单吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以&amp;也行的愉悦清单：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 啥是愉悦清单啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">02:49</a> “被需要”的感觉谁懂！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="431">07:11</a> </span><del><span>适当的</span></del><span>“浪费”时间本身就是一件很幸福的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a> 冥想和做梦，逃离现实生活的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> 和喜欢的人一起追晚霞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> 走！出门！吹风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> 自言自语和K歌是我们给情绪找的出口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1577">26:17</a> 当“植物杀手”见证到生命的力量（下滑可解锁花生苗的最新形态）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1989">33:09</a> 你我都是嗅觉动物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2301">38:21</a> 特殊的解压方式：看化妆品修复视频和别人写钢笔字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2487">41:27</a> 收纳是P人的最后的努力</span></p><span></span><p><span>以上就是我们俩目前整理出来的愉悦清单啦，但是清单的内容肯定是会随着生活慢慢的更新的，如果我们的轻松时刻也能够让你觉得愉悦舒适的话，那就太酷啦！也欢迎你一起来分享属于自己的轻松时刻呀，让我们一起来扩充愉悦清单吧！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘿嘿，下面是我们种的花生哦~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhJq6kFOfAKkSP2-S40qrogZCK_k.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1 Rollin' On - 椅子乐团 The Chairs</span></p><span></span><p><span>2 Tea For Two - Jack Jezzro And Friends</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你想更多的了解我们，也可以通过以下途径找到我们噢~</span></p><span></span><p><span>添加微信：Moooyg / 微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7921210187" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7921210187"><span>磨洋工播客</span></a><span> / 小红书： </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/650e2625000000001603a915?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=650e2625000000001603a915&amp;apptime=1720956686&amp;share_id=a0eff99fcb824e8da4ae14b6c143e599" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/650e2625000000001603a915?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=650e2625000000001603a915&amp;apptime=1720956686&amp;share_id=a0eff99fcb824e8da4ae14b6c143e599"><span>磨洋工</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>好事慢慢磨，我们下期再见～</span></strong></p>]]></description>
